  "notes": "{勤務|きんむ} refers to working or serving at a job, especially formal employment. As a suru-verb, it means \"to work (at)\", \"to be employed (at)\".\n\nCommon compounds:\n- {勤務|きんむ}⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧ (working hours)\n- {勤務|きんむ}⟦{先|さき}→先：02883_saki⟧ (place of work)\n- {勤務|きんむ}⟦{態度|たいど}→態度：03396_taido⟧ (work attitude)\n- ⟦{交代|こうたい}→交代：14943_koutai⟧{勤務|きんむ} (shift work)\n- ⟦{夜勤|やきん}→夜勤：09549_yakin⟧ / ⟦{夜間|やかん}→夜間：04133_yakan⟧{勤務|きんむ} (night shift)\n- ⟦{在宅|ざいたく}→在宅：07696_zaitaku⟧{勤務|きんむ} (working from home)\n\nRelated terms:\n- ⟦{出勤|しゅっきん}→出勤：04548_shukkin⟧ (going to work)\n- ⟦{退勤|たいきん}→退勤：04550_taikin⟧ (leaving work)\n- ⟦{欠勤|けっきん}→欠勤：07732_kekkin⟧ (absence from work)",
